lRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kT04yeFpjV0ZMZFRKbmFreE9WbFI2WVRVMVNHYxAB", "author": "M. Asif Khan", "rating": 4, "text": "Best Food quality but its costly.", "published_at": "2026-07-27T14:23:03.300Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21JM2MyUmxTMWRNYkcxb2NteHNORTR5VlVKWWVIYxAB", "author": "Romesh Tripathi", "rating": 5, "text": "Excellent taste", "published_at": "2026-07-26T14:36:43.268Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxMVpUZEZUbE0xV1dkd1kwTjFNRUpuZUVkRGNFRRAB", "author": "Eden Martin", "rating": 4, "text": "", "published_at": "2026-07-26T07:09:53.791Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KMFltUkhaV3RwY3pkbFUybDZWRTFzU1ZKZlluYxAB", "author": "Vanshika Mishra", "rating": 5, "text": "THE FOOD , THE AMBIENCE , THE STAFF EVERYTHING WAS VERY NICE and the taste and quantity is also fabulous 😍", "published_at": "2026-07-23T14:49:53.122Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxcWEyUnlXRE5LTTNSTVUyRjFhMnBYVEVFME4xRRAB", "author": "RAJNANDINI SONI", "rating": 2, "text": "COFFEE IS NOT GOOD", "published_at": "2026-07-23T13:53:38.666Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kUlNucHpSRWgzUzFOeE0ySXhVRTUwZFVkZlZWRRAB", "author": "Dileep Ahirwar", "rating": 5, "text": "Really loved TCC! The cold coffee with brownie and the pasta were absolutely delicious, and the Exotic Paprika Rice was truly heartwarming. Every bite was full of flavor!", "published_at": "2026-07-22T15:19:15.730Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s4eWJWZDFURTB4WkZSTmJrMW5ORTVKZEZKT2NXYxAB", "author": "raja Jatav", "rating": 5, "text": "I absolutely loved thecoffeeconcept! The food and drinks tasted amazing. The cold coffee was incredibly refreshing, the pav bhaji was full of flavour,  I truly loved every bite and can't wait to visit again!", "published_at": "2026-07-22T15:14:45.093Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25RMk5qUlFhbWhpV1RjelIzRTVObG8zUlVFeVNsRRAB", "author": "Aaditri Anand", "rating": 1, "text": "The food was so bad that it gave me and my friends food poisoning. The noodles we ordered were overcooked and unseasoned, the pasta was very bland, the Manchurian was too salty and tasted awful, and the paneer pizza was strangely sweet. Overall, it was disgusting. The service was also extremely lethargic, we had to go up and remind the staff again and again to bring our orders to our table.", "published_at": "2026-07-20T19:53:03.500Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aaWEzaFFORUpKVFRKYWJHWmxMVkV5TFZWUlRrRRAB", "author": "Om Agrawal", "rating": 5, "text": "Badhiyaaaa", "published_at": "2026-07-15T09:05:48.338Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xZmNYRjVUMnhrZWsxS1NtRjBOazVKWVVWakxYYxAB", "author": "Kanishk Raikwar", "rating": 5, "text": "One of the best spots in the town…W coffee & drinks, ambience is goated nd i personally liked the blue curacao mojito", "published_at": "2026-07-14T16:33:11.680Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCM00yNXJaSFZPTFVaMWJpMTZla1p2YTBoUVNWRRAB", "author": "Vivek Nayak", "rating": 4, "text": "Finally found a actual coffee place in Jabalpur where proper coffee is made l", "published_at": "2026-07-12T12:42:46.603Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5NVMzbHdWMXBpWjI5V1UzUnJUMmRGY1RsNWEzYxAB", "author": "Mona Sundaram", "rating": 5, "text": "A quaint little place with a lovely ambience that’s perfect for a relaxed evening. The food is delicious, although the portion sizes could be a bit more generous. Their variety of cold coffees is truly impressive—don’t miss the Caramel and Tiramisu cold coffees; they’re absolutely worth trying! The menu has plenty of options and offers great value for money. Overall, it’s a wonderful place to unwind with friends or cousins. Kudos to the team for creating such a lovely experience! 😍", "published_at": "2026-07-12T05:44:09.867Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jelFVaHdiSGhoVUhCa2VWZEZhMVp3VkZCaVpWRRAB", "author": "Ayush Samuel", "rating": 5, "text": "", "published_at": "2026-07-05T12:38: