elt like it had any cheese on it. We also ordered a chocolate brownie sizzler, but the brownie tasted completely burnt, and the burnt flavor overpowered the entire dessert.\n\nWe informed the staff about the issue, but there was no replacement offered, nor was there any adjustment made to the bill. Even the sauces were served in just a single small packet instead of proper bottles or adequate portions.\n\nOverall, the food quality and customer service did not meet expectations. It was quite disappointing considering how much we were looking forward to the experience.", "published_at": "2026-06-06T16:28:24.031Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxR09IWjRhRGhDY2s5aU1YQlpjM05sYlRkWU1YYxAB", "author": "Deeksha Jain", "rating": 5, "text": "Amazing", "published_at": "2026-06-04T13:21:49.195Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOMVgyaGZRMWxLTXpGb1JXRnpkbU5SYURsV1RFRRAB", "author": "Mahak Asati", "rating": 5, "text": "Amaze", "published_at": "2026-06-04T13:21:37.364Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xFNGNESXpNM1p5V214RFprSkRiMjF0Y1RSVFFrRRAB", "author": "Namrata Tiwari", "rating": 1, "text": "", "published_at": "2026-06-03T16:04:49.962Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOSFMwbzFVazlsWDJkV1ptWlNXRWxxUVZkUGVHYxAB", "author": "Guntas Grover", "rating": 2, "text": "bro portions were the size of an atom although food was good", "published_at": "2026-06-03T14:55:23.642Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xjd01rWXpOMGhaTjNSQ2RtNUJTbUZ3ZFZKdVVVRRAB", "author": "muskan gulabwani", "rating": 5, "text": "Staff and experience was to good", "published_at": "2026-05-31T15:39:19.434Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25rNE4wSXRWWEpTZFdKdlVIRnFjRXhTUmkwNFlYYxAB", "author": "Balram Vishwakarma", "rating": 5, "text": "", "published_at": "2026-05-31T12:03:32.756Z"}, {"external_id": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WalJFbEhRWHBITW5SWWQzcFBkSEJzTlVGWlRsRRAB", "author": "Geetesh Mahobia", "rating": 5, "text": "", "published_at": "